      "SubmissionTime": "2024-07-26T19:05:15.000+00:00",
      "ReviewText": "I received this edger and it would not start.  Badger sent me a new one and that one didn't start either.  The first one I got had a crooked front wheel.  The second one I got it had a straight front wheel.  Working with Badger to see what to do.  They do not take returns and the call center has about a 10 minute wait.  Tell's you a lot about their quality.  Also, the repair shop in Grand Prairie (40 miles away) does not answer the phone nor do they return messages.  Very frustrated about this purchase since I spent $25 for non-ethanol gas for this edger and it won't start.",
